  "description": "VOCKUW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H183 Dy3 Fe6 N6 O36,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe5 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe6 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.047-3.374 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.19-105.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C91H187Dy3Fe6N6O37.",
